194-    skip_when: "config.fanout is absent"
195-    instructions: |
196-      Fan-out mode is active. Spawn all lineages. Each lineage runs the full loop in its own
197:      isolated sub-packet under {artifact_dir}/lineages/{label}/.
198-      fanout-run.cjs owns native and CLI lineage execution; native is run through the
199:      deep/research command surface with config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir so the LEAF
200-      deep-research agent is used only for individual iterations, never as a full-loop
201-      sub-agent or pasted phase-running prompt.
202:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and
203:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in
204:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.
205-    sub_steps:
206-      step_fanout_spawn_cli:
207-        description: "Spawn all native and CLI lineages in capped worker pool"
