691-        algorithm: |
692:          1. if iteration_count >= max_iterations: STOP (maxIterationsReached). This terminal cap bypasses quality-guard overrides; record failed guards/blockers as synthesis evidence instead of continuing.
693-          2. if stuck_count >= config.stuckThreshold: STUCK_RECOVERY
694-          3. if convergence_mode == "off": skip convergence stop candidates and continue unless a terminal cap, pause sentinel, or recovery halt has already fired.
695-          3a. if stop_policy == "max-iterations" AND iteration_count < max_iterations: steps 4 and 5 are telemetry only and cannot set STOP or BLOCKED. Record weighted_stop_score for diagnostics, keep decision = "CONTINUE" and choose a broader next focus.
